      "message": "\u003e Maybe platform modules are also using __ANDROID_API__\u003d16?\n\nNo. I see that before this change, both core and vendor variants were built with aarch64-linux-android29 due to the min_sdk_version setting on libcap. With this change, min_sdk_version is ignored for the vendor variant.\n\nI think we need to choose min(min_sdk_version, vndk_version) for the vendor variants.",
