      "writtenOn": "2021-07-16T18:08:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I meant libcap itself. crtbegin_dynamic.so was 1000 for the core variant, and 16 for the vendor variant. The reason for 16 is aosp/1445696. After that change, SplitPerApiLevel returns false for the vendor variant of crt objects. I guess the difference in crtbegin_dynamic.so doesn\u0027t affect the core-vendor-diff check because the check is only for VNDK libraries and crtbegin_dynamic.so is not a VNDK library but a vendor-available library.",
      "parentUuid": "b67caa14_7608fcea",
      "revId": "bb0207732c083ec35da9c386f4ff7a7ed809eff5",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
